            "snippets": [
              "# Trade negotiators for U.S. and China hold ‘constructive’ phone talks\nU.S. and Chinese trade officials held a “constructive” phone conversation on Tuesday, White House economic adviser Larry Kudlow said, marking a new round of talks after the world’s two largest economies agreed to a truce in a year-long trade war",
