          "snippet": "Renewed trade war fears triggered a bond market recession indicator on Thursday. The yield on the 10-year Treasury note fell below that of the 3-month bill Thursday morning, inverting part of the yield curve."
        },
        "https://www.cnbc.com/2019/05/24/us-bonds-in-focus-on-wall-street-amid-ongoing-trade-war-worries.html": {
